@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Hayah Tayeba | child-only MVP use cases
actor Child
actor "Content admin" as Admin
rectangle "Hayah Tayeba" {
 usecase "UC-01\nStart / resume own profile" as Access
 usecase "UC-02\nExplore Dhikr journey" as Learn
 usecase "UC-03\nSave, resume and complete" as Progress
 usecase "UC-06\nAuthor, review and publish" as Publish
 usecase "UC-07\nRevise / withdraw content" as Revise
 usecase "UC-08\nManage own access and data" as Manage
 usecase "UC-09\nPlan / continue practice" as Practice
 usecase "UC-10\nCreate character / explore map" as Character
 usecase "UC-11\nPublish language edition" as Locale
 usecase "UC-12\nOptional reflection" as Reflect
}
Child --> Access
Child --> Learn
Child --> Progress
Child --> Manage
Child --> Practice
Child --> Character
Child --> Reflect
Admin --> Publish
Admin --> Revise
Admin --> Locale
legend bottom
The child is the only learner-facing role.
Content admins cannot access learner records.
UC-04 and UC-05 are retired, not active use cases.
endlegend
@enduml
